{"ticker":"HOOD","updated":"2026-10-23T23:04:54Z","profile":{"longName":"Robinhood Markets, Inc.","shortName":"Robinhood Markets, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","country":"United States","website":"https://robinhood.com","fullTimeEmployees":2900,"marketCap":85475753984,"trailingPE":41.881058,"forwardPE":27.834953,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":17.33085,"pegRatio":1.64,"targetMeanPrice":134.90466,"targetHighPrice":170.0,"targetLowPrice":57.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":30,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.323,"earningsGrowth":0.476,"grossMargins":0.9189,"operatingMargins":0.43884,"profitMargins":0.42011002,"totalRevenue":4931999744,"beta":2.354,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":150.47,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":63.515,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Robinhood Markets, Inc. operates financial services platform in the United States. The company's platform allows users to invest in stocks, exchange-traded funds (ETFs), and American depository receipts. It offers fractional trading, recurring investments, access to investing on margin, fully-paid securities lending, cash sweep, instant withdrawals, retirement program, around-the-clock trading, joint investing accounts, event contracts, future contract services, and short selling. The company also provides various learning and education solutions comprise Snacks, an accessible digest of business news stories for a new generation of investors; Learn, which is an online collection of guides, feature tutorials, and financial dictionary; Newsfeeds that offer access to free, premium news from sites from various sites, such as Barron's, Reuters, and Dow Jones. In addition, the company offers In-App Education, a resource that covers investing fundamentals, including why people invest, a stock market overview, and tips on how to define investing goals, as well as allows customers to understand the basics of investing before their first trade; and Crypto Learn and Earn, an educational module available to various crypto customers through Robinhood Learn to teach customers the basics related to cryptocurrency. Further, it provides Robinhood credit cards, cash card and spending accounts, a","summary_zh":"Robinhood Markets, Inc. 在美國經營金融服務平台。該公司的平台允許用戶投資股票、交易所交易基金（ETF）和美國存託憑證。它提供部分交易、經常性投資、保證金投資、全額支付證券借貸、現金掃描、即時提款、退休計劃、全天候交易、聯合投資帳戶、事件合約、期貨合約服務和賣空。該公司還提供各種學習和教育解決方案，包括 Snacks，這是為新一代投資者提供的商業新聞故事摘要； Learn，在線指南、特色教程、金融詞典合集；新聞源提供對來自不同網站（例如 Barron's、Reuters 和 Dow Jones）的免費優質新聞的訪問。此外，該公司還提供應用內教育，這是一種涵蓋投資基礎知識的資源，包括人們投資的原因、股票市場概述以及如何定義投資目標的技巧，並允許客戶在第一次交易之前了解投資的基礎知識； Crypto Learn and Earn，這是一個透過 Robinhood Learn 向各種加密貨幣客戶提供的教育模組，旨在向客戶傳授與加密貨幣相關的基礎知識。此外，它還提供 Robinhood 信用卡、現金卡和消費帳戶、","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資本市場","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":108.49,"h":109.85,"l":105.95,"c":107.94,"v":29478100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":106.85,"h":109.36,"l":105.12,"c":108.8,"v":27361000},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":108.69,"h":109.27,"l":102.81,"c":102.92,"v":35942700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":104.0,"h":105.4,"l":102.76,"c":103.69,"v":26059100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":102.84,"h":104.4,"l":101.93,"c":104.03,"v":22269200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":100.34,"h":101.9,"l":97.9,"c":100.84,"v":40899100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":101.59,"h":102.69,"l":99.41,"c":100.82,"v":24194800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":100.75,"h":104.75,"l":100.6,"c":102.91,"v":30626300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":104.98,"h":106.03,"l":95.66,"c":101.25,"v":62538400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":110.63,"h":117.3,"l":110.12,"c":117.28,"v":102382400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":116.53,"h":118.7,"l":113.76,"c":118.5,"v":51536300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":120.83,"h":123.44,"l":116.69,"c":117.46,"v":46671200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":117.88,"h":121.69,"l":117.37,"c":117.75,"v":35760900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":117.93,"h":118.57,"l":114.05,"c":115.03,"v":37245800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":115.345,"h":116.53,"l":112.425,"c":114.83,"v":36787500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":115.06,"h":118.13,"l":113.79,"c":117.38,"v":36628500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":1