"2026-10-20","zh":"PLTR 價格預測：瑞穗將目標上調至 245 美元，因為動能停滯在範圍中點"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"加密貨幣","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1783879/000178387926000023/hood-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Robinhood was founded in 2013 on the belief that everyone should be welcome to participate in our financial system. We are creating modern financial services platforms for everyone, regardless of their wealth, income, or background.","zh":"Robinhood 成立於 2013 年，其信念是歡迎每個人參與我們的金融體系。我們正在為每個人創建現代金融服務平台，無論他們的財富、收入或背景如何。"},{"en":"Our mission is to democratize finance for all. We use technology to provide access to the financial system in a way that is simple and convenient for our customers. We believe the financial system should be built to work for everyone. That's why we create products that let our customers start investing at their own pace, on their own terms. We believe investing should be familiar and welcoming, with a simple design and an intuitive interface, so that customers are empowered to achieve their goals. We started with a revolutionary, bold brand and design in the Robinhood app which makes investing approachable for millions. Over the last decade, we have disrupted and changed the industry, becoming the first U.S. retail broker to offer commission-free stock trading with no account minimums, which was subsequently adopted by the rest of the industry. In recent years, we have continued to build","zh":"我們的使命是使所有人的金融民主化。我們利用科技為客戶提供簡單便捷的金融系統存取權限。我們認為金融體系的建立應該為所有人服務。這就是為什麼我們創造的產品可以讓我們的客戶以自己的步調、以自己的條件開始投資。我們相信投資應該是熟悉和受歡迎的，具有簡單的設計和直覺的介面，以便客戶能夠實現他們的目標。我們從 Robinhood 應用程式中革命性的、大膽的品牌和設計開始，這使得數百萬人的投資變得平易近人。在過去的十年中，我們顛覆並改變了這個行業，成為美國第一家提供無帳戶最低限額的免佣金股票交易的零售經紀商，隨後被行業其他公司採用。近年來，我們不斷打造"},{"en":"At Robinhood, our values are in service of our customers. Our customers are why we exist. That is why we put what's best for our customers at the center of our decision-making in order to bring them the best technology coupled with real value. That is why at Robinhood, we push for progress without compromising quality. We also take our responsibility for our customers' finances seriously. We know that trust is hard earned and easily lost and that is why we prioritize compliance, approach risk thoughtfully, and never compromise trust for speed.","zh":"在 Robinhood，我們的價值觀是為客戶服務。我們的客戶是我們存在的理由。這就是為什麼我們將最適合客戶的因素置於我們決策的中心，以便為他們帶來最好的技術和真正的價值。這就是為什麼在 Robinhood，我們在不犧牲品質的情況下推動進步。我們也認真對待客戶的財務責任。我們知道，信任來之不易，也很容易失去，這就是為什麼我們優先考慮合規性，深思熟慮地處理風險，並且從不為了速度而犧牲信任。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We understand that millions of our customers have used Robinhood to enter the financial markets for the first time, and we take our responsibility to them seriously. We are passionate about operating Robinhood in a way that aligns with customer interests, applicable regulations, and with our own mission to democratize finance for all. We continue to create an ecosystem of financial products and services that will enable people across the world to become investors. We believe our products can transform the","zh":"我們了解數百萬客戶首次使用 Robinhood 進入金融市場，我們認真對待我們對他們的責任。我們熱衷於以符合客戶利益、適用法規以及我們為所有人實現金融民主化的使命的方式來運作 Robinhood。我們繼續創造金融產品和服務的生態系統，使世界各地的人們都能成為投資者。我們相信我們的產品可以改變"},{"en":"relationship people have with the financial system and that the products on our roadmap will go a long way toward making that a reality.","zh":"人們與金融體系之間的關係，我們路線圖上的產品將大大有助於實現這一目標。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We are empowering a new generation of financial consumers. Robinhood was built to make the financial system more accessible and transparent for everyone. We have reached customers from a wide variety of social and economic backgrounds and many of our customers have told us that Robinhood was their first brokerage account. We take pride in the fact that we are expanding the market by welcoming new investors into the financial system and helping the next generation of investors build sound long-term investing, saving, and spending habits in their prime wealth building years. We are also laser focused on being the top platform for active traders who trade more actively and use more sophisticated products.","zh":"我們正在為新一代金融消費者提供支援。 Robinhood 的建立是為了讓金融體系對每個人來說都更容易存取和透明。我們接觸到了來自各種社會和經濟背景的客戶，許多客戶告訴我們 Robinhood 是他們的第一個經紀帳戶。我們感到自豪的是，我們正在透過歡迎新投資者進入金融體系來擴大市場，並幫助下一代投資者在其財富累積的黃金時期建立良好的長期投資、儲蓄和消費習慣。我們也致力於成為活躍交易者的頂級平台，這些交易者交易更活躍，使用更複雜的產品。"},{"en":"Customer feedback is at the heart of product development at Robinhood. We regularly communicate with our customers—not just to provide support, but also to learn more about their experiences and insights, and to respond to their feedback about our products. This keeps us connected with customers and enables us to understand their expectations, problems and opportunities they face financially. For example, in response to customer feedback, we introduced multiple accounts, allowing customers to open multiple investing accounts to organize their portfolio by asset class, time horizon, investing themes, or personal goals, all in one place. Further, in response to feedback from our active traders for advanced equity offering, we launched short selling, an important feature designed to give active traders a way to profit in down or volatile markets, and to smooth out equity trading volumes acr","zh":"客戶回饋是 Robinhood 產品開發的核心。我們定期與客戶溝通，不僅是為了提供支持，也是為了更多地了解他們的經驗和見解，並回應他們對我們產品的回饋。這使我們與客戶保持聯繫，並使我們能夠了解他們的期望、他們在財務上面臨的問題和機會。例如，為了回應客戶的回饋，我們引入了多個帳戶，允許客戶開設多個投資帳戶，並按資產類別、時間範圍、投資主題或個人目標組織他們的投資組合，所有這些都在一個地方。此外，為了回應活躍交易者對高級股票發行的回饋，我們推出了賣空功能，這是一項重要功能，旨在為活躍交易者提供在下跌或波動的市場中獲利的方式，並平滑股票交易量。"}],"competition":[{"en":"We believe that we are changing the consumption patterns for financial products and services and growing the market, but will continue to face competition from other firms including large legacy financial institutions, large technology companies, and smaller, new financial technology entrants.","zh":"我們相信，我們正在改變金融產品和服務的消費模式並發展市場，但仍將面臨其他公司的競爭，包括大型傳統金融機構、大型科技公司和規模較小的新金融技術進入者。"},{"en":"We seek to differentiate ourselves from competitors primarily through our vertically integrated mobile and desktop platforms, and focus on accessibility, customer experience, and trust. We believe that our ability to innovate quickly further differentiates our platforms from our competition. We believe we compete favorably across all key competitive factors and that we have developed a business model that is difficult to replicate.","zh":"我們主要透過垂直整合的行動和桌面平台來使自己與競爭對手區分開來，並專注於可訪問性、客戶體驗和信任。我們相信，我們的快速創新能力進一步使我們的平台在競爭中脫穎而出。我們相信，我們在所有關鍵競爭因素上都處於有利競爭狀態，我們已經發展出難以複製的商業模式。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Transaction Based Revenues","val":2628000000,"zh":"基於交易的收入"},{"name":"Options","val":1123000000,"zh":"選項"},{"name":"Cryptocurrencies","val":901000000,"zh":"加密貨幣"},{"name":"Financial Service Other","val":331000000,"zh":"金融服務其他"},{"name":"Equities","val":302000000,"zh":"股票"},{"name":"Other Transaction Based Revenues","val":302000000,"zh":"其他基於交易的收入"},{"name":"Gold Subscription Revenues","val":179000000,"zh":"黃金訂閱收入"},{"name":"Other Revenue","val":89000000,"zh":"其他收入"},{"name":"Proxy Revenues","val":63000000,"zh":"代理收入"}],"total":4473000000}},"peers":["COIN","SOFI","PLTR","CRWV","MSTR"]}}